1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,740
Which snowflake is BIG?

2
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:03,917
Point to it!

3
00:00:05,917 --> 00:00:06,777
That one!

4
00:00:06,777 --> 00:00:08,283
The big snowflake!

5
00:00:08,533 --> 00:00:10,417
And this one is small.

6
00:00:10,967 --> 00:00:12,800
Make your hands big.

7
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:13,836
Now small!

8
00:00:17,136 --> 00:00:19,062
A snowflake on my nose!

9
00:00:19,062 --> 00:00:21,136
Is my nose warm, or cold?

10
00:00:24,436 --> 00:00:25,036
Drip!

11
00:00:25,236 --> 00:00:28,412
Warm! A warm nose melts snow.

12
00:00:31,362 --> 00:00:34,518
A snowflake on my red mitten!

13
00:00:34,768 --> 00:00:37,780
Is my mitten warm, or cold?

14
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:42,549
Cold! So the snowflake stays!

15
00:00:43,099 --> 00:00:44,474
Cold keeps snow.

16
00:00:44,474 --> 00:00:45,849
Warm melts snow!

17
00:00:47,699 --> 00:00:49,113
Flap, flap!

18
00:00:49,113 --> 00:00:50,122
Whoosh!

19
00:00:51,722 --> 00:00:54,506
Are the snowflakes going fast,

20
00:00:54,506 --> 00:00:55,434
or slow?

21
00:00:57,434 --> 00:00:59,665
Fast! Swirly and fast!

22
00:01:00,215 --> 00:01:01,919
Share with a friend and

23
00:01:01,919 --> 00:01:04,083
subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

24
00:01:04,583 --> 00:01:06,151
Watch the full story

25
00:01:06,151 --> 00:01:07,719
on Honey Bunny Kidz!
